# The renderer's dependency tree, and the intermediates. The film's *sources*
# are committed — the script, the timeline, the scenes, and the recording every
# terminal in it replays — along with the finished cut, its thumbnail and its
# manifest, so that a judge who clones the repository has the deliverable
# rather than a link to it.
node_modules/
output/*
!output/decimal-rs-port-mortem-2026.mp4
!output/decimal-rs-port-mortem-2026-thumbnail.png
!output/decimal-rs-port-mortem-2026-manifest.json
